     "design": {
      "purpose": "Add fractions with different denominators.",
      "principles": [
       "PRINCIPLE_SYSTEMATIC_VARIATION"
      ],
      "rationale": "Some pairs of denominators share a factor, such as 4 and 6, and some do not, such as 3 and 4. When they share a factor, the product of the denominators works but is not the least. Some sums are more than 1 or can be simplified, so students check the answer's form.",
